{"id":"f733a11305f2610a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-weak2-pi01.md","title":"弱 2 随机点所在有效闭类测度为正","display":"thm-weak2-pi01 — 弱 2 随机点所在有效闭类测度为正","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-weak2-pi01","aliases":["43-thm-weak2-pi01"],"display":"thm-weak2-pi01 — 弱 2 随机点所在有效闭类测度为正","depends_on":["[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-weak2random]]","[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-thm-weak2-ml]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-weak2-pi01"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-weak2-pi01</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-weak2-pi01 — 弱 2 随机点所在有效闭类测度为正"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e434343f51a33e9\" href=\"?note=2e434343f51a33e9\" title=\"43-thm-weak2-ml\">43-thm-weak2-ml</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span>；相关谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上的有效闭类谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> 在这里仅是该复合标识的一部分，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\">\\(\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上给出的公平硬币 Borel 概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X)\\land\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land X\\in P\\Rightarrow\\mu(P)&gt;0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X)\\land\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land X\\in P\\Rightarrow\\mu(P)&gt;0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有效闭P测度零，其递减可计算闭开近似有趋零测度，形成广义检验。实际上ML随机性已足够。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak2random","status":"resolved","id":"1a145b88092ce22e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-weak2random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-weak2-ml","status":"resolved","id":"2e434343f51a33e9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-weak2-ml]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak2random","status":"resolved","id":"1a145b88092ce22e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesi