X)\\land\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land X\\in P\\Rightarrow\\mu(P)>0.","display":true}],"bytes":1619,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-weak2-pi01]] — 弱 2 随机点所在有效闭类测度为正"}],"outgoing":["ab1ef7b1cac112c1","1a145b88092ce22e","cc07cf2b9ec0019e","8e999d59227f4a28","2e434343f51a33e9"]}